<title>JAPAN: Toyoko Riken -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toyoko Riken -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 37.03		vs	   35.89</p>
<p> Operating	  472    million	  vs	  605    million</p>
<p> Current	    425    million	  vs	  403    million</p>
<p> Net		  108    million	  vs	   80    million</p>
